              "text": "opifex, opificis — \"a craftsman, a worker\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Opifex mēnsam novam fēcit. The craftsman made a new table."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "opifex, opificis m. and f. Built from opus, work, and faciō, to make: a work-maker."
            }
          ]
        },
