            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Operāriī tōtum diem in agrō labōrant. The labourers work all day in the field."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "operārius, operāriī m., a man who works with his hands for a wage, built on opera, work, effort."
